## 2. Free personal and internal business use

Subject to this license, the Licensor grants you a worldwide, nonexclusive,
royalty-free copyright license to use, run, copy, study, and modify the Software
for your own personal use or your organization's internal business operations.
This permission applies to individuals, sole proprietors, companies of any
size, nonprofits, and other organizations, including for-profit businesses.

You may use the Software to operate a revenue-generating business, manage your
own customers, leads, appointments, staff, and records, and provide your own
customers with booking or account portals connected to those operations.
Earning revenue from your own goods or services while using the Software as
an operational tool does not require separate commercial permission.

You may deploy your own instance on your own infrastructure or a hosting
provider. Employees and contractors may install, operate, and modify it on
your behalf for these permitted purposes. Paying a contractor for installation,
customization, maintenance, or support of your own instance is permitted.
These permissions do not authorize the contractor to sell a packaged copy or
to offer the Software as a commercial CRM or scheduling service.

You retain your rights in your own data and outputs, such as customer records,
reports, and booking confirmations. These restrictions do not apply to those
outputs unless they contain copies of the Software itself.

